 Since current request already large, maybe first list files and plan, then next request? But each call count; 33 enough. We can combine plan update and list_files and read_pdf? Tool result all. If read_pdf 5-8 plus list files, maybe budget? System prompt maybe 10k, current evidence no? Tool result is new request; prior contents may be compacted. Let's think token/char contexts exactly. We see current user message (system+task+tool evidence) approx 25k chars. If we call read_pdf 5-8, next request likely includes system/task (~11k), conversation messages (our code block, tool results) perhaps all current evidence catalog? It may not repeat current tool evidence unless included? Current request includes tool results because we explicitly called get_evidence? Actually last model output called get_evidence for ev-000009? The current user message is tool result for get_evidence with evidence 9, plus pinned other ev 2-9. It pinned many because get_evidence? Hmm last turn maybe get_evidence(ev-000009) returned the evidence and also pinned previous? The entire current request has 9 evidence entries, most exposed true. Why? We didn't output that call in visible conversation, but transcript begins with tool results. Likely harness pinned all recent evidence automatically. This request is ~26k chars. If call read_pdf 5-8 (~14k), plus this history could exceed 32k. But harness likely compacts older tool results? It may show current batch only and maybe notes. Rules: \"剩余模型请求数... 合理合并读取、计划和验证工具\". Should combine but budget.\n\nWe can call read_pdf 5 only first? Need 48 pages, one call per page too many 48 >33. Batches 2-3 pages. But request overhead could be okay if old evidence dropped. We need trust framework. Could call plan update + list_files + read_pdf(5,7). If new ~10k, request maybe <32k after compaction. Let's do plan update and read_pdf 5-8. But to save application info, list_files maybe. Could use read_pdf 5-8 and update plan. We'll see.\n\nNeed all 52 pages \"真实调用 re