ion prompting\"; Generative Agents 100 human evaluators?\noutlook: Table 4 five topics; shared foundations reasoning and planning? Let's find.\n\nNeed exact quotes, pages.\n\nLet's call read_pdf pages 1-4? already exposed but need capture notes details. We can get_evidence pages 1-5 maybe pin. Better read PDF 5-8 first, plus maybe pages 1-4 via get_evidence. Tools can multiple. Since each response only one code block, multiple tool calls allowed sequentially but errors stop. Let's do get_evidence ev 5... maybe 1 through 8? It pins all in next request, could be huge (32k) but current page contents 1-4 already ~16k; 5-8 additional ~16k -> over 32k. Need select pages 5-6 perhaps; page 7-8 already page8 exposed. page1-4 have content. We can rely on visible. Need page 1 for title/contributions? page3 has contributions categories. Search methods page 5. Let's read 5-7 via read_pdf maybe output full. Also update plan maybe later."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 8567, "completion_tokens": 640, "total_tokens": 9207, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 3712}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 621}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 3712, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 4855}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}}
