aybe.\n\nLet's update plan and request pages 1,2 via get_evidence plus 9,10? Multiple get_evidence. This will pin 4 pages, maybe 18k chars. Then save overview and maybe tool_use notes. But current context already ~? Pages 11-14 ~14k. Add 18k too much. Hmm.\n\nMaybe the 32k limit is enforced per API request and runtime truncates older messages? The system says \"PDF原文按完整页面分批入模\" and \"当前请求\". We need obey. We should not add too much. We can get_evidence one page at a time. Page 1 likely 5.5k. Page 2 4.7k. We need determine categories search methods. We can use search_code? PDF not text file. read_pdf pages 1-2. That is one command; output ~10k. Fine if current request 14k +10k =24k. Let's do read_pdf 1-2? But already exposed; still need exact quotes. It will add again. Could use get_evidence ev-000014 page1 and ev-000015 page2; only content 10k. Let's do that, and save note overview. However, note must include answer details.\n\nWait, `get_evidence` pins in next model request. If we call get_evidence now, tool result returns content immediately? Yes. Then next model request includes it. We can then save_note in same response? No, need sequential model turns. Each tool call response is a model turn, counts request. We should call get_evidence and then in next assistant response use content. That's two calls.\n\nAlternatively read_pdf 1-2 and save note might require two turns. Same.\n\nWe have 26 calls. Let's map:\n1 get pages 1-2\n2 save overview note\n3 get pages 9-10\n4 save tool note\n5 read 15-18\n6 save multi-agent maybe (depends)\n7 read 19-24\n8 read 25-30\n9 read 31-36\n10 read 37-42\n11 read 43-48\n12 read 49-52\n13 save notes reasoning/tool/multi/outlook\n14 final report\n15 pytest\n16 fix\n17 finish.\n\nNeed maybe multiple saves per call? save_note only one topic per call. But one assistant turn can execute multiple tools sequentially; if multiple save_note, all okay. Could save 5 notes in one turn if content known and sources visible. Great.\n\nWe need read 52 pages, but pages 1-14 done. Need pages 15-52. Let's first read 15-18. Each ~3-4k => ~14k. Current request 11-14 14k; total 28k. Fine. Use read_pdf 15-18. Actually we need ensure pages 15-18 content. Let's do plan update + read_pdf. One code block can call update_plan and read_pdf."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 8983, "completion_tokens": 1553, "total_tokens": 10536, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 3840}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1437}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 3840, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 5143}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}}
