sequent real request. We can save them one call after reading all. save_note each tool call? It says one note record; can call multiple tools one code block. Good. Each note sources visible evidence IDs. Need evidence visible in current request. We can cite pages seen. But content can draw from pages read previously even if not in current context? It says notes from evidence visible; sources should be current request-evidence IDs. We need pin relevant pages via get_evidence so they're in current request.\n\nLet's first read pages 40-43. Also maybe page 44-47. But total context. We'll use read_pdf 40-42 because need Generative Agents evaluators; likely page 40. Then page 44? tool_use maybe not needed from future. Pages 40-52 include applications and discussion/outlook. Need Table 4 likely page 50-51.\n\nLet's do read_pdf 40-42 first."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 9043, "completion_tokens": 1603, "total_tokens": 10646, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 3840}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1481}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 3840, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 5203}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}}
