may be OCR pieces; likely page 1-39 correspond ev-1..39? But ev-32 page20 indicates mismatch due multiple evidence per page? Hmm recent: ev32 page20, ev33 page21 ... ev43 page31 etc. So pages 1-19 likely 20 evidence chunks, maybe page 1 has two evidence. Need use get_evidence known from context? We don't have IDs of older pages. Could call read_pdf pages necessary, but that adds new evidence IDs and page text visible. We need read all 52; pages 40-52 new. Then retrieve answer pages by reading selected pages with read_pdf (will show content) or get_evidence if IDs. We can use read_pdf 40-52 in one call? 13 pages maybe ~50k chars > 32k if all entered. Tool result may be large but system only says batch complete content; but request body budget 32k. We need read_pdf batches. We need 40-46, 47-52 perhaps. We can call two read_pdf in one response? That may return huge results maybe total 50k, exceeding context. Better one call pages 40-45 (~ maybe 30k), then 46-52. Current request already includes ~?? 15k. Tool result added next request. We have 12 calls, can do batches of 5-6 pages. Need ensure full-read check likely requires read_pdf covering all 52 pages; already pages 1-39 exposed, likely command_record. We need pages 40-52. Let's do 40-45 first."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 9043, "completion_tokens": 730, "total_tokens": 9773, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 3840}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 654}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 3840, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 5203}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}}
